The AX88179A-based chips support VLAN offload. Add configuration
support in netdev_ops. Features supported are:
NETIF_F_HW_VLAN_CTAG_TX, NETIF_F_HW_VLAN_CTAG_RX
and NETIF_F_HW_VLAN_CTAG_FILTER.

